  "id": "incompatible-response",
  "term": "incompatible response",
  "definition": "An incompatible response is a reaction tendency that conflicts with the response required by the current task or goal. In the source context, it refers to an incorrect response that can be primed by irrelevant stimulus information and thereby interfere with goal-directed behavior.",
